      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    qualified_expenses = 8500\n    magi = 85000\n    credit_rate = 0.20\n    phase_out_start = 80000\n    phase_out_end = 90000\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    eligible_expenses = min(qualified_expenses, 10000)\n    potential_credit = eligible_expenses * credit_rate\n\n    if magi >= phase_out_end:\n        llc_credit = 0.0\n    elif magi > phase_out_start:\n        phase_out_fraction = (phase_out_end - magi) / (phase_out_end - phase_out_start)\n        llc_credit = potential_credit * phase_out_fraction\n    else:\n        llc_credit = potential_credit\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(llc_credit, 2)\n```",
